policy-engine (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * XDP policy-based packet processing engine
  * Server/client architecture with GraphQL API
  * 5-tuple matching with LPM trie for CIDR prefixes
  * IPv4 and IPv6 support
  * Per-rule and global statistics

